msgstr "B<%C>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"(Not in B<tcsh>(1).)  Name and command-line arguments of the command being "
"timed."
msgstr ""
"(Nicht in B<tcsh>(1).) Name und Befehlszeilenargumente des gemessenen "
"Programms."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0
